WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.800
Classic, the traditional game, plus four new games of our own.

2
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:18.600
Classic. Every row, column and box holds 1 to 9 once. Hints teach the next step.

3
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:24.400
Rival Grid. Take turns against a computer rival. Every right number claims the cell. Most cells wins.

4
00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:30.000
Chain Reaction. Link each move to the last one's row, column or box. Longer chains score more.

5
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:35.600
Tidewater. Water hides some clues. Every right number drains the cells around it.

6
00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:41.200
Glyph Quest. Numbers become glyphs. Finish lines to earn powers and travel the quest map.
